    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As part of AKU's 40th anniversary festivities, the University hosted a research showcase titled 'At The Tipping Point'. The event, which was a first of its kind in AKU's history, was attended by Princess Zahra Aga Khan. The event aimed to showcase the University's dynamic research beyond the boundaries of education, health and life sciences.",
